6-09-27 132245.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2432×1146 40.7 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot: 0.57.1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt-in Grok Bot agent computer (not a model issue)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo request ID available. The app cannot reach the agent computer, and in-app Send Feedback also fails to deliver.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-additional-information-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-additional-information-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStarted after updating the app about a week ago. Retry, Recover computer and Reset all fail; I have stopped running Reset to avoid worsening the partial state. Please rebuild my agent computer from the backend and confirm my files, bots and logins are preserved. Location: Dubai, UAE. I only use the Grok Bot desktop app, not the Cursor IDE.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502181-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502181-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-27T17:33:43.796Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":9,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":45.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":173136,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-for-7-days-since-update-recover-and-reset-failed-partial-state","display_username":"Ahmed Elkiki","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140020,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-cant-reach-your-computer-for-7-days-since-update-recover-and-reset-failed-partial-state/173136/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":502188,"name":"Ahmed Elkiki","username":"Ahmed_Elkiki","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/a587f6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T17:38:48.808Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI tried the sign out and sign-in met